NAME
    pack - reclaim deleted space

SYNOPSIS
    pack

DESCRIPTION
    Compacts the filesystem, reclaiming the space left by deleted or
    moved files (P8XFS frees extents lazily). Run it to recover room on a
    full card. pack is an OS built-in command that operates on the
    current drive.

EXAMPLES
    pack

SEE ALSO
    del, mv, fsck, format
